*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% =====================================================================
*% 南科大云打印 —— PDF 直通 PPD
*%
*% 这份 PPD 只做一件事：让 CUPS 认为"这台设备直接吃 application/pdf"，
*% 从而在 PDF 输入时套用 cost 为 0 的 `-`（直通）滤镜，把 PDF 原样交给
*% backend，不经过 pstops / cgpdftops / Ghostscript。
*%
*% 为什么不干脆用 raw 队列：macOS 26 的 lpadmin 已经明确拒绝
*%   $ lpadmin -p Q -E -v file:/dev/null -m raw
*%   lpadmin：macOS不再支持原始队列。
*% 所以只能用"极简 PPD + PDF 直通滤镜"来达到同样的效果。
*%
*% 注意：这里**故意**不声明 application/postscript。声明了就会走
*% cgpdftops（PDF→PS），而本机没有任何 PS→PDF 转换器，等于把作业变成
*% 无法处理的格式。现在这样，PS 输入会被 CUPS 在提交阶段就拒绝，
*% 用户能立刻看到错误，而不是等到 backend 里才发现。
*% =====================================================================
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageEncoding: UTF-8
*LanguageVersion: Chinese (Simplified)
*PCFileName: "sustech-print.ppd"
*Manufacturer: "SUSTech"
*ModelName: "SUSTech Cloud Print"
*NickName: "云打印"
*ShortNickName: "SUSTech Cloud Print"
*Product: "(云打印)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:SUSTech;MDL:SUSTech Cloud Print;CMD:PDF;"
*OpenUI *PageSize/纸张: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.276 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A3/A3: "<</PageSize[841.89 1190.55]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize ISOB5/ISOB5: "<</PageSize[498.898 708.661]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/纸张区域: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4: "<</PageSize[595.276 841.89]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion A3/A3: "<</PageSize[841.89 1190.55]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ISOB5/ISOB5: "<</PageSize[498.898 708.661]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Legal/Legal: "<</PageSize[612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12.7 12.7 582.576 829.19"
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "12.7 12.7 599.3 779.3"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "12.7 12.7 829.19 1177.85"
*ImageableArea ISOB5/ISOB5: "12.7 12.7 486.198 695.961"
*ImageableArea Legal/Legal: "12.7 12.7 599.3 995.3"
*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595.276 841.89"
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "841.89 1190.55"
*PaperDimension ISOB5/ISOB5: "498.898 708.661"
*PaperDimension Legal/Legal: "612 1008"
*OpenUI *Resolution/分辨率: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: "<</HWResolution[600 600]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution
*OpenUI *Duplex/双面打印: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *Duplex
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/单面（不翻转）: "<</Duplex false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/双面 · 长边翻转（像书本）: "<</Duplex true /Tumble false>>setpagedevice"
*Duplex DuplexTumble/双面 · 短边翻转（像便签）: "<</Duplex true /Tumble true>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Duplex
*% 关键：声明本设备直接接受 PDF，直通滤镜（命令 `-`，cost 0）。
*% -- 这一条保证 PDF 原样到达 backend --------------------------------------
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/vnd.cups-pdf 0 -"
*% 让文本/图片也能用：CUPS 先用 cgtexttopdf / cgimagetopdf 转成 PDF，
*% 再走上面的直通分支。这样 `lp -d 南科大云打印 说明.txt` 也能工作。
*cupsFilter2: "text/plain application/pdf 33 cgtexttopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "application/x-shell application/pdf 33 cgtexttopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "application/x-cshell application/pdf 33 cgtexttopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "application/x-csource application/pdf 33 cgtexttopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "application/x-perl application/pdf 33 cgtexttopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "image/* application/pdf 25 cgimagetopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-banner application/pdf 33 cgbannertopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-command application/vnd.cups-command 0 commandtops"
*End of File
